# =============================================================================
# Per-Dockerfile ignore for e2e/Dockerfile.staging-parity
# =============================================================================
#
# BuildKit looks for `<dockerfile>.dockerignore` next to the Dockerfile passed
# to `-f` and, when present, uses it INSTEAD of the build-context-root
# `.dockerignore` (it replaces, it does not merge). The patterns below are
# still evaluated relative to the build context root (the repo root).
#
# Why this file exists:
#
#   The root .dockerignore excludes `e2e/` and `playwright.config.ts` so they
#   never leak into PRODUCTION service images (correct hygiene). But THIS
#   Dockerfile is the staging-parity TEST harness — it must COPY exactly those
#   files (the spec + the playwright config). Without a per-Dockerfile ignore,
#   the root rules win and `COPY playwright.config.ts` / `COPY e2e/*.spec.ts`
#   fail with "not found" (empty build context).
#
#   This file is the root .dockerignore MINUS the two `e2e/` +
#   `playwright.config.ts` exclusions, so the harness build sees the handful of
#   test files it needs while every production-hygiene exclusion (node_modules,
#   .git, .env secrets, dist, docs) is preserved verbatim. No regression to
#   production image builds — those still use the root .dockerignore.
# =============================================================================

# ── Build artifacts ──
dist/
docs/api/
docs/db-structure/
playwright-report/
workbench/
trash/
archive/
mobile-app/
.claude/
*.tsbuildinfo

# ── Dependencies (installed fresh in Docker) ──
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
.npm/
bun.lockb
.venv/
**/.venv/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/

# ── Version control ──
.git/
.gitignore
**/.git

# ── IDE / Editor ──
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ── Environment / Secrets ──
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ── Tests & Development ──
# NOTE: `e2e/` and `playwright.config.ts` are deliberately NOT excluded here
# (unlike the root .dockerignore) — the staging-parity harness COPYs them.
src/tests/
vitest.config.ts
coverage/
test-results/

# ── Docker (prevent recursive context) ──
docker-compose*.yml
compose*.yml
Dockerfile*
.dockerignore

# ── Logs ──
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# ── OS files ──
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ── Documentation (not needed in image) ──
docs/
knowledge-extraction/
AGENTS.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
README.md
RULES.md

# ── Supabase local dev (not needed in production image) ──
supabase/.temp/
supabase/.branches/
